<p><a href="https://philpeople.org/profiles/charles-scott-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Charles E. Scott</a>, Distinguished Professor of Philosophy and Research Professor of Philosophy Emeritus at Vanderbilt University and Professor of Philosophy Emeritus at Penn State University, known for his work in continental philosophy, has died.<span id="more-57050"></span></p>
<p>The following obituary is by <a href="https://philosophy.la.psu.edu/people/nat3/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nancy Tuana</a>.</p>
